{"4595540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Touhou Erosion ~ The Fallen Shrine Maiden of Paradise", "steam_appid": 4595540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The prayers have ended. The purification begins.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious abyss has begun to consume the once-peaceful Gensokyo. The maidens have fallen into madness, their instincts and magic distorted by the Erosion. As the last beacon of hope, you must suppress the corrupted girls and reclaim the pure light within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupted Paradise Survivor:</strong> Experience a new level of action combining traditional Danmaku—featuring <strong>countless projectiles</strong>—with roguelite survival progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Corrupted Bosses:</strong> Face various bosses spiraling out of control due to the Erosion. Learn and adapt to each boss's unique bullet patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Armor Break:</strong> Brute force isn't enough. Pressure the bosses to trigger a 3-stage 'Armor Break' and seize the chance for purification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb and Reflect:</strong> Use the 'Dimensional Barrier' to convert enemy bullets into magical energy. Release the absorbed energy to wipe out the eroders across the screen.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The prayers have ended. The purification begins.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious abyss has begun to consume the once-peaceful Gensokyo. The maidens have fallen into madness, their instincts and magic distorted by the Erosion. As the last beacon of hope, you must suppress the corrupted girls and reclaim the pure light within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron